append.sd.path on | off\n\nON   put SD's program directory on the Windows system PATH.\nOFF  take it off.\n\nWith no keyword it reports the current setting and changes nothing.\n\nThis is what lets "sd" run from any directory. It is the SYSTEM PATH, so the\nchange applies to every account on this machine. A terminal that is already\nopen keeps the PATH it started with; open a new one to see the change.
